nt_msg_id":"953bf76b-fdb0-4eab-a69d-bd396867d2ee","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"どうしてddc.vimのロードが遅いままなのじゃあ","ts":"1637196521.224400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=RUWy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9267a7b3-2eca-4b68-a8d6-e5cc98d5a05d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"```# deno 1.16.2\n$ deno run --allow-net --no-check test.ts\n2\n# deno 1.16.1\n$ deno run --allow-net --no-check test.ts\n606```\n何回か試したらバラつきはありますが概ねこのぐらいの数値","ts":"1637196505.223900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"70Gux"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63f6bd4c-6058-4c4f-9db1-ccc7c7a12980","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"手元だとめちゃくちゃ早くなってますね\n\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12519\u003e\nここの `test.ts`","ts":"1637196420.222600","attachments":[{"color":"cb2431","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12519|#12519 Dynamic (remote) import is quite slow and seems not cached\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno/issues/12519|#12519 Dynamic (remote) import is quite slow and seems not cached\u003e","text":"I'm not sure if it's known but it seems remote dynamic import is quite slow. For example\n\n```\nasync function main() {\n  const t = performance.now();\n  await Promise.all([\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n  ]);\n  console.log(performance.now() - t);\n}\nawait main();\n```\n\nAbove took approx. 55 ms with `deno run -A --no-check ./test.ts`. It seems the number of remote imports in the target file affect the performance.\n\nAdditionally, it seems remote dynamic import does not use cache. For example\n\n```\n// test.ts\nasync function main() {\n  const t = performance.now();\n  await Promise.all([\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n    import(\"\u003chttps://deno.land/x/denops_core@v2.0.3/mod.ts\u003e\"),\n  ]);\n  console.log(performance.now() - t);\n}\nawait main();\n```\n\nAbove took approx. 500 ms with `deno run -A --no-check ./test.ts` even the URL is just repeated.","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"perf, cli","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"10","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/denoland/deno|denoland/deno\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1634908293}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gos9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9ccb9d1a-7370-441b-a203-29215257f48e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"12740の解消が主で12519はそこまで検証されていない？\nいやまさか","ts":"1637196220.221700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jum"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fad6ba1a-eb75-426a-921c-381b595be40a","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"試してもらえませんか","ts":"1637196034.220900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qnpF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b4ba829-5059-4385-8e19-ee741108ebd0","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"手元で試したところ別に高速化してない…。あれれ？","ts":"1637196029.220600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_t